From 1ab0a16085694829e4df252450238516b6630cef Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:32:37 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add ScreenLink UI page
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adds a self-contained, opt-in control panel for the existing
screenlink-server.js (server/screenlink-server.js), which previously had
no working front-end:

- server/public/screenlink.html — new page with a Host panel (start
  hosting, optional password, public listing + label, name allow-list,
  live viewer list, auto-run toggle, status broadcast, activity log,
  stop) and a Viewer panel (join by code or from the public list, open
  URLs/tabs on the host, send key presses/text, send files, play sounds
  with volume/stop, activity log).
- server/public/js/screenlink-ui.js — client logic: two independent
  Socket.IO connections (host/viewer) talking only to this same-origin
  server, implementing every event in the screenlink-server.js protocol.
- server/public/js/icons.js — added "monitor" and "copy" icons used by
  the new page.
- server/public/style.css — new .sl-* styles for the page, reusing
  existing shared classes (page-main, banner-row, granted-user-list,
  admin-divider, etc.) where possible.
- Added a "ScreenLink" nav link to the dock on all existing pages.

Note: server/public/screenlink.js (the old global, non-consensual
auto-connect client that silently linked every non-whitelisted visitor
to an external screenlink.hostless.app host) was already removed from
the working tree before this change and is not restored. The new page
only connects when a user explicitly clicks Start Hosting / Join, and
only to this server.

Verified end-to-end against a locally running server: host creates a
code, a viewer joins, open-url/tab-tracking/key-input all relay
correctly with no console errors.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RpAjM72uyYBLTNAVfftDRv
